<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets 2-wk repo at limit rate 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets 2-wk repo at limit rate 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Tuesday set a two-week reverse repo tender to drain liquidity at a limit rate of 14.5 percent, unchanged from Monday.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids was set for 0745 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
